  "summary": "Payload: Prototype pollution in Payload Import Export plugin",
  "details": "### Impact\nAn unauthenticated user could cause unintended application behavior when the Import Export plugin is enabled, allowing an attacker to submit and execute remote code (RCE).\n\nApplications that do not use `@payloadcms/plugin-import-export` are not affected.\n\n### Patches\nUsers should upgrade Payload packages to `>= 3.88.0` or `>= 4.0.0-canary.27.`\n\n### Workarounds\nUpgrading is recommended. Until then, disable the Import Export plugin or restrict access to its endpoints.",
